<title>USA: NYSE UNAVAILABLES.</title>
<headline>NYSE UNAVAILABLES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Wednesday that John H. Harland Co and Catalina Lighting Inc were unavailable for after-hours trading due to news.</p>
<p>Also unavailable were Corimon SACA and Terra Nitrogen Co LP.</p>
</text>
